            "status": "reverted",
            "contribution_type": "revert",
            "reverted_by": "Nikephoros Baris",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "{{fa}}If you're technically adept and interested in providing a service that helps the modern world go round, consider becoming an electrician. Licensed, or master, electricians are highly-trained technicians whose responsibilities include everything from replacing an electrical [[Replace a Defective Electrical Switch or Outlet|outlet]] to wiring a newly-constructed house or building. This article provides information on the work of an electrician, the educational and training requirements for becoming an electrician, and how to get your license.",
                    "[[Category:Tradesman Occupations]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "{{fa}}If you're technically adept"
                ]
            }
        },
